    "The alice + olivia event is independently dated to November 20, 2013 and publicly styled as the Kindness Project fashion-and-art collaboration.",
    "New York Penal Law Article 250 supports the one-party recording distinction; the archive separately evaluates ethics and publication consent.",
    "Contemporaneous reporting and later appeal coverage establish Mike Tyson's 1992 rape conviction; the episode's escort-to-the-door explanation is false.",
    "CDC guidance supports pain, soreness, itching and dyspareunia as possible candidiasis symptoms; the private partner's diagnosis is not republished.",
    "Sushi Nakazawa opened in New York in 2013 with Daisuke Nakazawa, known from Jiro Dreams of Sushi.",
    "The 8MM art credit, Vung Tau/Yao Ming restaurant story, Dark Dick archive, exact Capsule Labs credit and massage-oil release remain open research leads."
